# 🗄️ Database Management System — SQL Learning Journey

> A personal journey of learning **SQL** and **Database Management Systems (DBMS)** — one query, one problem at a time.

**Author:** [Pallavi Rani](https://github.com/PallaviRani01) &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Status:** 🟢 In Progress &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Stack:** SQL · MySQL / PostgreSQL / SQLite

📚 [Topics Covered](#-topics-covered) &nbsp;•&nbsp; 🧩 [Practice Problems](#-practice-problems) &nbsp;•&nbsp; 📁 [Repo Structure](#-repository-structure) &nbsp;•&nbsp; 🚀 [How to Use](#-how-to-use-this-repo) &nbsp;•&nbsp; 📈 [Progress](#-progress-tracker)

---

## 👋 About This Repository

This repository documents my journey of learning **SQL** and **Database Management Systems**.
It contains my notes, practice queries, and solutions to SQL problems as I build a strong foundation in databases — from basics like `SELECT` statements to advanced concepts like joins, subqueries, window functions, and normalization.

> 💡 **Goal:** Learn by doing — solve real problems, understand *why* a query works, not just *how*.

---

## 📚 Topics Covered

| # | Topic | Status |
|---|-------|:---:|
| 1 | SQL Basics (`SELECT`, `WHERE`, `ORDER BY`) | ⬜ |
| 2 | Filtering & Aggregation (`GROUP BY`, `HAVING`) | ⬜ |
| 3 | Joins (`INNER`, `LEFT`, `RIGHT`, `FULL`) | ⬜ |
| 4 | Subqueries & Nested Queries | ⬜ |
| 5 | Window Functions | ⬜ |
| 6 | Views, Indexes & Constraints | ⬜ |
| 7 | Stored Procedures & Triggers | ⬜ |
| 8 | Database Normalization (1NF–3NF) | ⬜ |
| 9 | ER Diagrams & Schema Design | ⬜ |
| 10 | Transactions & ACID Properties | ⬜ |

> Replace ⬜ with ✅ as you complete each topic to track your own progress.

